BLESSING, warp charge 6. If it is manifested, choose one of your SQUIG units within 12" of this PSYKER that it can see. Until the start of your next Psychic phase:
- when that unit fights, each squigosaur's jaws, smasha squig jaws, squighog jaws or Big Chompa's jaws it has can make 1 extra attack;
- when a model in that unit attacks with any of those jaws weapons, an unmodified wound roll of 6 also deals 1 mortal wound to the target on top of any normal damage.
